---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | DigiHawke Media"
  description="Privacy Policy for DigiHawke Media. Read how we collect, process, and safeguard your corporate and contact details in compliance with data privacy regulations."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-lowest to-background relative select-text">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--color-surface-container-low),_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-left">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-4 text-glow-indigo">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
        Last Updated: July 15, 2026
      </p>

      <!-- Mobile App Privacy Policy Callout -->
      <div class="mt-8 p-5 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] text-[11px] font-mono font-medium bg-secondary/10 text-secondary border border-secondary/20">
            Mobile Application
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white">SmartStaff AI</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
            Looking for our mobile application privacy policy? View the dedicated policy for <strong class="text-white">SmartStaff AI</strong> (SmartStaff Attendance Register) at <a href="/privacy-smartstaff" class="text-secondary underline hover:text-white">https://digihawke.com/privacy-smartstaff</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a 
          href="/privacy-smartstaff" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-secondary/10 hover:bg-secondary/20 text-secondary border border-secondary/30 rounded-[4px] text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-all duration-200 self-start sm:self-center"
        >
          <span>SmartStaff AI Policy</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Content Blocks -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-8">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to DigiHawke Media (“we,” “our,” or “us”). We operate the domain <a href="https://digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">digihawke.com</a>. This Privacy Policy outlines our procedures regarding the collection, storage, and processing of your corporate and personal information when you request a Growth Audit or subscribe to our newsletter services. For our mobile application <strong class="text-white">SmartStaff AI</strong>, please refer to our dedicated <a href="/privacy-smartstaff" class="text-secondary hover:underline">SmartStaff AI Privacy Policy</a> (https://digihawke.com/privacy-smartstaff).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            To provide high-quality marketing services and strategy audits, we collect information that you submit voluntarily through our interactive forms:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <li><strong>Identity Details</strong>: Full Name and corporate position.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Details</strong>: Work Email address and Phone Number.</li>
            <li><strong>Business Profiles</strong>: Company Website URL, current marketing ad spend parameters, and growth targets.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical Parameters</strong>: IP addresses, cookie logs, and general browser user-agents utilized during audit submissions.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Processing & Usage of Information</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            We process your information based on legitimate business operations. Your data is used to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <li>Generate custom search and conversion audits.</li>
            <li>Coordinate growth consultation schedules.</li>
            <li>Send newsletters containing marketing checklists and results summaries.</li>
            <li>Monitor and optimize website speed and interaction logs.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">4. Data Safety & Indian Regulations</h2>
          <p>
            Our data processing systems are aligned with the <strong>Information Technology Act, 2000</strong> and the <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act, 2023</strong> of India. We utilize secure hosting structures, encrypted socket connections, and access controls to prevent unauthorized leakages or data modifications.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-white mb-3">5. Cookie Practices</h2>
          <p>
            We use technical cookies to save layout configurations, monitor session timings, and save calculator parameters on the budget slider. You may disable cookies in your browser settings, though doing so might cause interactive elements to reset on reload.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60">
          <h2 class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">6. Contact Data Controller</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you have questions regarding database access, data deletion requests, or compliance, reach out to our strategy coordinator:
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
            <div><strong class="text-white">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:help@digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">help@digihawke.com</a></div>
            <div><strong class="text-white">Office:</strong> Barhaj, Dist - Deoria , Gorakhpur. U.P - 274601, India</div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
